如其神符。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m039-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"共王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m039-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"巴姬","kind":"person","person_id":"691_4u8_7bw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m039-0042","start":42,"end":45,"surface":"五公子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、寓言人物或未定指代，未補未見姓名、全體成員或親屬關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m039-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"康王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m039-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m039-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"子比","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m039-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"子皙","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m039-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m039-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"康王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m039-0095","start":95,"end":96,"surface":"圍","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m039-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m039-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"子比","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m039-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"子皙","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m039-0132","start":132,"end":134,"surface":"棄疾","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m039-0138","start":138,"end":140,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAE","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p040","text":"初，子比自晉歸，韓宣子問叔向曰：「子比其濟乎？」對曰：「不就。」宣子曰：「同惡相求，如市賈焉，何爲不就？」對曰：「無與同好，誰與同惡？取國有五難：有寵無人，一也；有人無主，二也；有主無謀，三也；有謀而無民，四也；有民而無德，五也。子比在晉十三年矣，晉、楚之從不聞通者，可謂無人矣；族盡親叛，可謂無主矣；無釁而動，可謂無謀矣；爲羈終世，可謂無民矣；亡無愛徴，可謂無德矣。王虐而不忌，子比渉五難以弒君，誰能濟之！有楚國者，其棄疾乎？君陳、蔡，方城外屬焉。苛慝不作，盜賊伏隱，私欲不違，民無怨心。先神命之，國民信之。羋姓有亂，必季實立，楚之常也。子比之官，則右尹也；數其貴寵，則庶子也；以神所命，則又遠之；民無懷焉，將何以立？」宣子曰：「齊桓、晉文不亦是乎？」對曰：「齊桓，衞姬之子也，有寵於釐公。有鮑叔牙、賓須無、隰朋以爲輔，有莒、衞以爲外主，有髙、國以爲内主。從善如流，施惠不倦。有國，不亦宜乎？昔我文公，狐季姬之子也，有寵於獻公。好學不倦。生十七年，有士五人，有先大夫子餘、子犯以爲腹心，有魏犫、賈佗以爲股肱，有齊、宋、秦、楚以爲外主，有欒、郤、狐、先以爲内主。亡十九年，守志彌篤。惠、懷棄民，民從而與之。故文公有國，不亦宜乎？子比無施於民，無援於外，去晉，晉不送；歸楚，楚不迎。何以有國！」子比果不終焉，卒立者棄疾，如叔向言也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"子比","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"韓宣子","kind":"person","person_id":"4rk_808_kn9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"叔向","kind":"person","person_id":"7he_05e_e75","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"子比","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"宣子","kind":"person","person_id":"4rk_808_kn9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"子比","kind":"person","pers